Package: openfortivpn-manager-headless
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ppp, systemd
Maintainer: baozaodetudou
Description: Headless HTTPS and CLI manager for multiple OpenFortiVPN tunnels
 Provides a systemd service, Bearer-token Web console, profile management,
 concurrent split-tunnel instances and automatic reconnect.
